[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12073.75, "timestamp": "03:21:13", "text": "所以没有随机数生成器，只是哦，这里有随机数生成器。 这里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12077.269, "timestamp": "03:21:17", "text": "存在随机数生成器（RNG）。 这就是为什么我们需要这样做，因为这里存在随机数生成器（"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12079.429, "timestamp": "03:21:19", "text": "RNG）。 这就是为什么我们一遍又一遍地种植同样的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12088.229, "timestamp": "03:21:28", "text": "让我来给你演示一下。 我们坐上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12089.91, "timestamp": "03:21:29", "text": "电车了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12091.91, "timestamp": "03:21:31", "text": "没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12095.75, "timestamp": "03:21:35", "text": "唉，我运气真不好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12099.11, "timestamp": "03:21:39", "text": "所以，没有陷阱吗？ 嗯，明白了。 这就像《"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12102.469, "timestamp": "03:21:42", "text": "命运》一样，比如在《"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12105.83, "timestamp": "03:21:45", "text": "命运》中，如果你需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12108.95, "timestamp": "03:21:48", "text": "武器或护甲的极品属性，你就会一遍又一遍地刷"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12111.429, "timestamp": "03:21:51", "text": "同一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12113.99, "timestamp": "03:21:53", "text": "任务，直到获得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12119.349, "timestamp": "03:21:59", "text": "好的掉落，对吧？ 这里也是一样，"}]